# src/data/ is SOURCE, not a bulk dataset: it holds the declarative
# historical-squad catalogue Draft and Match Lab both import. The
# blanket data/ rule above matches it, so it is re-included here --
# the directory must be un-ignored before a file inside it can be.
!src/data/
!src/data/**
!docs/src/data/
!docs/src/data/**
db/
/identity/

*- vanilla/
